# Personal overrides for `task dev`. Copy to .env.dev (ignored by git) and set
# only what you need; task dev:prepare merges it over the generated stack
# environment, and each process still receives only the variables its config
# spec declares. The variables are documented in services/main/.env.example,
# services/account/.env.example and apps/web/.env.example. This file is not
# named .env.local because Bun loads that automatically into every process,
# including tests.
#
# MAIN_NOTIFICATION_PROVIDER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8025/api/v1/send
# MAIN_NOTIFICATION_INTERVAL_MS=5000
